        "text_FUxeeN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At AstroAura.market, we are committed to providing our customers with a smooth, transparent, and secure payment experience. Our pricing and payment policies are designed to ensure clarity and fairness for both domestic and international customers.</p><h3>Accepted Payment Methods</h3><p>We support a wide range of payment channels to make checkout convenient:<br/>Domestic Payments (India): Credit cards, debit cards, UPI, net banking, and digital wallets.<br/>International Payments: PayPal, Stripe, and other secure international gateways.<br/> All transactions are processed through trusted payment providers to maintain the highest level of data security and compliance with industry standards.</p><h3>Pricing Transparency</h3><p><br/>For Indian Customers: All prices listed on our website are inclusive of applicable GST or other local taxes, unless otherwise specified.<br/>For International Customers: Prices are displayed in INR and/or USD for convenience. However, depending on the destination country, customs duties, import charges, or local taxes may apply, which are the responsibility of the buyer.</p><h3>Currency & Exchange Rates</h3><p>While we primarily display prices in INR (₹) and USD ($), international transactions may be subject to fluctuations in exchange rates and currency conversion fees determined by your bank or payment provider. AstroAura.market is not responsible for these additional charges.</p><h3>Pricing Errors & Adjustments</h3><p>In the event of a typographical error, system glitch, or incorrect pricing displayed due to technical issues, AstroAura.market reserves the right to:<br/>Cancel the order prior to shipment.<br/>Notify the customer and adjust the pricing accordingly.<br/>Provide the option of continuing the purchase at the correct price or receiving a full refund.</p><h3>Order Confirmation & Invoicing</h3><p><br/>Upon successful payment, customers will receive an order confirmation email with transaction details.<br/>An invoice including price breakdown, taxes, and shipping (if applicable) will be issued digitally for every order.</p><h3>Security & Fraud Prevention</h3><p><br/>All payments are processed over encrypted and secure channels (SSL-certified).<br/>For security reasons, AstroAura.market may request additional verification or identification from customers in case of high-value or suspicious transactions.<br/>Orders found to be fraudulent or unauthorized will be cancelled immediately, and appropriate action will be taken.</p>"
          }
